Package: istesso
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: maromocooo <3402352+maromocooo@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: pipewire, systemd
Description: Show an application of another PC in a window of this one
 Istesso lets a PC show, with low latency, the window of an application
 that runs on another PC. This package contains the command line tool and
 the agent that answers paired devices.
